*.bin
# The notebook is the one thing in this tree that is written by running the
# machine, and it belongs to whoever is using it rather than to the repository.
# `make notebook-forget` deletes it; this only keeps git from offering to.
session.log
# The URBIT_DIAG debugger is deliberately not shipped: it proved "/urbit/vere" is
# not the problem, the fix for what it found is in the init's -c handling now,
# and it stays in this tree for the next silent comet.  Restore it with
# `git apply urbit/urbit-diag.patch`.
urbit/urbit-diag.patch
